<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Ceylon Tea Q2 net down 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Ceylon Tea Q2 net down 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited consolidated results for the second quarter ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				   Q2 1996	Q2 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		   153.85   vs    90.62</p>
<p>    Net profit		   7.81   vs     9.28</p>
<p>    Tax			    1.00   vs     1.50</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Tea Services Ltd manufactures and exports tea bags. The company did not give reason for the fall in profit despite a sharp rise in turnover.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
